			"value": "<p>You wield yourself with innate skill. If you're a martial weapon, you count as a simple weapon for determining your proficiency; if you're an advanced weapon, you count as a martial weapon. This doesn't affect other weapons of your kind. At 5th level, whenever you critically hit with yourself, you gain its critical specialization effect.</p>"
